| Priority | What | How |
|---|---|---|
| 1 | `DefaultExcerptGenerator` (100% identical) | Extract to top-level class in package |
| 2 | `listSnapshots` (100% identical) | Extract to abstract base class |
| 3 | `cleanUpResources` (differs only in type token) | Abstract base with `<T extends Extension>` param |
| 4 | `subscribeNewCommentNotification` (differs in 2 string constants) | Extract helper taking `(ownerName, reasonType, exprTemplate)` |
| — | `getExcerpt` bug: `.setRaw(content.getRawType())` in SinglePageReconciler:394 | One-line fix |

